_code,\r\n  source,\r\n  trace_id,\r\n  ext_json,\r\n  created_at\r\nFROM hyd_water_level_src;\r\n"}','MEDIUM',0,1,0,0,-1,-1,'【离线计算】查询水位实时数据，生成每日统计报表',100,'1','0','吴同',2,TO_DATE('2025-09-23 09:09:26.498000','YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS.FF'),'吴同',2,TO_DATE('2025-09-23 09:09:26.498000','YYYY-MM-DD HH24:MI:SS.FF'),null,'53');

